// Article 4. Architectural changes: approval, and approval by silence.
#require "1-association.charter".
Role committee Is ArchitecturalCommittee
Fact change
Fact applied Identified by owner * change
Fact approved Identified by owner * change
Fact refused Identified by owner * change

Act apply Actor owner Recipient committee Related to change
  Holds when True
  Creates change, applied(owner, change)
Act approve Actor committee Recipient owner Related to change
  Holds when applied(owner, change)
  Creates approved(owner, change)
Power refuse Actor committee Recipient owner Related to change
  Holds when applied(owner, change)
  Valid when !Held(applied(owner, change)) For 30 days
  Creates refused(owner, change)
Fact permitted Identified by owner * change
  Holds when approved(owner, change)
          || (Held(applied(owner, change)) For 30 days && !refused(owner, change))
Act make-change Actor owner Related to change
  Holds when permitted(owner, change)

Clause 4.1 => committee, make-change, approve
Clause 4.2/1 => apply
Clause 4.2/2 => permitted, make-change, refuse
Clause 4.3 => refuse.
